DATA — CC BY-SA 4.0
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Applies to data/visa.json, which is a derivative of these English Wikipedia
articles, licensed CC BY-SA 4.0:

  Visa requirements for United States citizens
  Visa requirements for Russian citizens
  Visa requirements for Israeli citizens
  Israeli travel document in lieu of national passport

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Reuse of that file must keep the attribution and stay under CC BY-SA 4.0. The
Israeli laissez-passer layer additionally contains original editorial judgement
that is NOT from Wikipedia — see the README before relying on it.

